DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The oowwiidd driver provides support for the 1-Wire serial number family type
     device.  This device can't do anything except report its unique serial
     number.  The serial number is available through the sysctl(8) interface.

     The following chips are supported by the driver:

           ••   Maxim/Dallas DS1990

